{"id": "formula-7de3d2738cef45ef", "latex": "\\begin{aligned}(\\Gamma_5D\\Gamma_5)_{i,j}&=\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}P&&\\\\&\\ddots&\\\\&&P\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}D_{1,1}&\\cdots&D_{1,16}\\\\\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\D_{16,1}&\\cdots&D_{16,16}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}P&&\\\\&\\ddots&\\\\&&P\\end{bmatrix}\\right)_{i,j}\\\\&=\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}PD_{1,1}P&\\cdots&PD_{1,16}P\\\\\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\PD_{16,1}P&\\cdots&PD_{16,16}P\\end{bmatrix}\\right)_{i,j}\\\\&=PD_{i,j}P.\\end{aligned}", "source_pages": [67], "block_id": "gamma-five-block-verification", "review_status": "agent-reviewed", "bbox_precision": "page body region, not token-tight"}
