{"id": "formula-8f65619ff0aed58d", "latex": "\\begin{aligned}(\\Gamma_5D\\Gamma_5)_{1,2}&=PD_{1,2}P\\\\&=(\\gamma_5\\otimesI_3)[(I_4-\\gamma_4)\\otimesU_4([1,1,1,1])](\\gamma_5\\otimesI_3)\\\\&=\\gamma_5(I_4-\\gamma_4)\\gamma_5\\otimesU_4([1,1,1,1])\\\\&=(I_4-\\gamma_5\\gamma_4\\gamma_5)\\otimesU_4([1,1,1,1])\\\\&=(I_4+\\gamma_4)\\otimesU_4([1,1,1,1])\\\\&=[(I_4+\\gamma_4)^{\\mathrmH}\\otimesU_4^{\\mathrmH}([1,1,1,1])]^{\\mathrmH}\\\\&=[(I_4+\\gamma_4)\\otimesU_4^{\\mathrmH}([1,1,1,1])]^{\\mathrmH}\\\\&=D_{2,1}^{\\mathrmH}.\\end{aligned}", "source_pages": [67], "block_id": "gamma-five-block-verification", "review_status": "agent-reviewed", "bbox_precision": "page body region, not token-tight"}
